{"uid":"sn1.59","title":"A Partner","reference":"Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.59","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["“What is a person’s partner?","What instructs them?","Enjoying what is a mortal","released from all suffering?”","“Faith is a person’s partner.","Wisdom instructs them.","Delighting in extinguishment a mortal","is released from all suffering.”"]}]}
